    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Strength Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=YorssyWMumAsvzx3]], [[lookup @target.affects.special activity=YorssyWMumAsvzx3]] by the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} (it can have up to two creatures swallowed at a time).</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> The target is swallowed by the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}, and the Grappled condition ends. A swallowed creature has the &amp;Reference[Blinded apply=false] and &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] conditions, it has &amp;Reference[Total Cover] against attacks and other effects outside the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}, and it takes [[/damage average activity=zrWNjO9mkbN28spL]] damage at the start of each of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s turns.</p><p class=\"feature\">If the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} takes 30 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} must succeed on a [[/save format=long activity=rGeGukkm2t2fXsoy]] at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, each of which falls in a space within [[lookup @range.value activity=rGeGukkm2t2fXsoy]] feet of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} and has the &amp;Reference[Prone apply=false] condition. If the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} dies, any swallowed creature no longer has the Restrained condition and can escape from the corpse by using 15 feet of movement, exiting Prone.</p><div class=\"cat-description\"><p><em>midi-qol: A creature Grappled by it that fails the save is swallowed (up to 2 at a time): Restrained, Blinded and with Total Cover, it rides inside and takes the damage at the start of each of the remorhaz's turns. 30 or more damage from inside in one turn makes it save at the end of that turn or regurgitate them all, prone. At 0 hit points they get out, prone.</em></p><p><em>Automation requires Coven's Automation Toolkit (CAT).</em></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
